  "body": "## Finding description and impact\n`validatePrice()` attempts to compute a **TWAP** but reconstructs it using the current spot price and the same cumulative value, which algebraically cancels to the spot price. As long as `elapsedTime > 0`, the computed **timeWeightedAverage** equals **tradePrice**, so derivation is always **0**, and the check passes even with `slippage = 0`. This effectively disables slippage protection wherever the oracle is used.\nIf any value‑moving action (swap, liquidity removal, or burn) relies on `validatePrice()` as a safety gate, an attacker can manipulate the Uniswap V2 spot price for a single block (e.g., via flash liquidity) and pass the check, leading to bad execution and potential value loss.\n\n## Recommended mitigation steps\nReplace this logic with a true TWAP derived from historical observations. For Uniswap V2, use cumulative prices across two timestamps and compute `(priceCumulativeNow - priceCumulativeLast) / timeElapsed` with a stored past snapshot.",
  "proof_of_concept": "```solidity\n// SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT\npragma solidity ^0.8.30;\n\nimport {Test} from \"forge-std/Test.sol\";\n\nimport {UniswapPriceOracle} from \"../contracts/oracles/UniswapPriceOracle.sol\";\nimport {BalancerPriceOracle} from \"../contracts/oracles/BalancerPriceOracle.sol\";\nimport {LiquidityManagerETH} from \"../contracts/pol/LiquidityManagerETH.sol\";\nimport {NeighborhoodScanner} from \"../contracts/pol/NeighborhoodScanner.sol\";\nimport {ERC20TokenOwnerless} from \"../contracts/test/ERC20TokenOwnerless.sol\";\nimport {ZuniswapV2Factory} from \"../lib/zuniswapv2/src/ZuniswapV2Factory.sol\";\nimport {ZuniswapV2Pair} from \"../lib/zuniswapv2/src/ZuniswapV2Pair.sol\";\n\ninterface IFactoryV3 {\n    function getPool(address tokenA, address tokenB, uint24 fee) external view returns (address pool);\n}\n\ncontract PoC_Oracles is Test {\n    address internal constant OLAS = 0x0001A500A6B18995B03f44bb040A5fFc28E45CB0;\n    address internal constant WETH = 0xC02aaA39b223FE8D0A0e5C4F27eAD9083C756Cc2;\n    address internal constant ROUTER_V2 = 0x7a250d5630B4cF539739dF2C5dAcb4c659F2488D;\n    address internal constant POSITION_MANAGER_V3 = 0xC36442b4a4522E871399CD717aBDD847Ab11FE88;\n    address internal constant FACTORY_V3 = 0x1F98431c8aD98523631AE4a59f267346ea31F984;\n\n    function _setupZuniswapPair() internal returns (address pair, ERC20TokenOwnerless token0, ERC20TokenOwnerless token1) {\n        token0 = new ERC20TokenOwnerless();\n        token1 = new ERC20TokenOwnerless();\n        ZuniswapV2Factory factory = new ZuniswapV2Factory();\n        pair = factory.createPair(address(token0), address(token1));\n\n        token0.mint(address(this), 10 ether);\n        token1.mint(address(this), 1000 ether);\n        token0.transfer(pair, 1 ether);\n        token1.transfer(pair, 100 ether);\n        ZuniswapV2Pair(pair).mint(address(this));\n    }\n\n    function test_UniswapValidatePrice_NoOp_SlippageZeroPasses() public {\n        (address pair, ERC20TokenOwnerless token0, ) = _setupZuniswapPair();\n        UniswapPriceOracle oracle = new UniswapPriceOracle(address(token0), 10_000, pair);\n        vm.warp(block.timestamp + 1);\n        bool ok = oracle.validatePrice(0);\n        assertTrue(ok);\n    }\n```",
